1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,000
[Dalzollene] At nine tonight,

2
00:00:02,000 --> 00:00:03,000
the mummy of Princess Corco

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:05,000
will be sold off
at the Underground Auction.

4
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:09,000
Ivlenkov, Tocino, and Baise.

5
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:11,000
You’ll be responsible for the bidding.

6
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:14,000
And… The rest of us?

7
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:17,000
[Dalzollene] Basho and Linssen
will be covering the rear entrance.

8
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:21,000
Kurapika and Melody
will take the front entrance.

9
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:25,000
Squala and I will guard the girl.

10
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:27,000
And so...

11
00:00:27,000 --> 00:00:29,000
the mission will now begin.

12
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:38,000
[theme song playing]

13
00:01:49,000 --> 00:01:53,000
A x SHOCKING x TRAGEDY

14
00:01:57,000 --> 00:01:59,000
[narrator] It has come to the attention
of the Nostrade family

15
00:01:59,000 --> 00:02:03,000
that someone plans
to attack the Underground Auction

16
00:02:03,000 --> 00:02:05,000
which is put on by the Mafia community.

17
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:10,000
Kurapika and all of the other bodyguards
hired by the Nostrades

18
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:12,000
have begun their assignments.

19
00:02:33,000 --> 00:02:35,000
Looks like everyone’s here.

20
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:38,000
Almost all of them are Mafia bosses.

21
00:02:38,000 --> 00:02:40,000
We’ve got some real heavy hitters here.

22
00:02:42,000 --> 00:02:43,000
[Baise] I'm surprised.

23
00:02:44,000 --> 00:02:45,000
Yeah? Why is that?

24
00:02:45,000 --> 00:02:47,000
Well, this is only an auction.

25
00:02:47,000 --> 00:02:49,000
So, they could have sent proxies
in their place.

26
00:02:51,000 --> 00:02:54,000
Maybe it’s because they feel
like their honor is on the line.

27
00:02:54,000 --> 00:02:56,000
For each winning bid,

28
00:02:56,000 --> 00:02:58,000
five per cent goes back
into the Mafia community.

29
00:02:58,000 --> 00:03:00,000
It’s kind of like a commission.

30
00:03:01,000 --> 00:03:03,000
[Baise] I see. So, in that case…

31
00:03:03,000 --> 00:03:05,000
does it act as a bribe?

32
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:06,000
Like the more money they bid,

33
00:03:07,000 --> 00:03:08,000
the more they’ll get back in return?

34
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:13,000
The Mafia has to flex its
financial muscle somehow or other,

35
00:03:13,000 --> 00:03:15,000
and this way is pretty effective.

36
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:16,000
Oh, I get it.

37
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:19,000
It’s basically a chance for them
to improve their standing.

38
00:03:20,000 --> 00:03:21,000
Yeah, and as a result,

39
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:23,000
a few of the gangs
have actually gone bankrupt,

40
00:03:24,000 --> 00:03:26,000
overbidding themselves into oblivion.

41
00:03:28,000 --> 00:03:31,000
It should be starting any minute now.

42
00:03:38,000 --> 00:03:40,000
UNDERGROUND AUCTION

43
00:03:54,000 --> 00:03:55,000
Uh…

44
00:03:55,000 --> 00:03:59,000
I would like to welcome you
to the Underground Auction.

45
00:04:01,000 --> 00:04:03,000
Enough formalities.

46
00:04:03,000 --> 00:04:06,000
Let’s just get down
to the business at hand, shall we?

47
00:04:11,000 --> 00:04:12,000
[all three gasp]

48
00:04:13,000 --> 00:04:14,000
Time for you to die!

49
00:04:15,000 --> 00:04:16,000
[dying groans]

50
00:04:25,000 --> 00:04:28,000
DUAL MACHINE GUN:
AMBIDEXTROUS AUTOMATIC WEAPONS

51
00:04:29,000 --> 00:04:30,000
Get down!

52
00:04:31,000 --> 00:04:32,000
Black Balloons…

53
00:04:32,000 --> 00:04:34,000
Protect us!

54
00:04:36,000 --> 00:04:39,000
ELEVEN ASSISTANTS:
THANKLESS HEROES!

55
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:46,000
[gasps in shock]

56
00:04:46,000 --> 00:04:49,000
Is he… using Nen bullets?

57
00:04:49,000 --> 00:04:51,000
That means he’s an Emitter, too!

58
00:04:52,000 --> 00:04:55,000
It won’t be long before those bullets
penetrate my Nen barrier

59
00:04:55,000 --> 00:04:57,000
and rip through my body.

60
00:04:58,000 --> 00:05:00,000
Every one of ‘em packs a hell of a punch!

61
00:05:00,000 --> 00:05:02,000
-This isn’t good!
-[dying groans]

62
00:05:03,000 --> 00:05:04,000
Run away!

63
00:05:04,000 --> 00:05:06,000
Go and tell the boss that there--

64
00:05:15,000 --> 00:05:18,000
Go, Baise! I’ll be right behi-- [groans]

65
00:05:24,000 --> 00:05:25,000
[Baise] [terrified exhale]

66
00:05:27,000 --> 00:05:29,000
[cackles]

67
00:05:58,000 --> 00:06:00,000
[Franklin] That was a lot easier
than I thought it would be.

68
00:06:01,000 --> 00:06:03,000
[Feitan] I didn’t get to do anything.

69
00:06:05,000 --> 00:06:06,000
It’s all yours, Shizuku.

70
00:06:06,000 --> 00:06:07,000
Right.

71
00:06:08,000 --> 00:06:10,000
Blinky? Let’s go.

72
00:06:12,000 --> 00:06:14,000
[cackling]

73
00:06:15,000 --> 00:06:17,000
Suck up all traces of the victims
from the room.

74
00:06:18,000 --> 00:06:20,000
Their blood, body parts,

75
00:06:20,000 --> 00:06:22,000
and all of their personal possessions.

76
00:06:23,000 --> 00:06:24,000
Get the chairs, too.

77
00:06:39,000 --> 00:06:40,000
Her Nen ability...

78
00:06:41,000 --> 00:06:42,000
is always fun to watch.

79
00:06:43,000 --> 00:06:44,000
-Hey.
-Hm?

80
00:06:44,000 --> 00:06:46,000
[mafioso groaning in pain]

81
00:06:48,000 --> 00:06:50,000
Someone is still alive.

82
00:06:52,000 --> 00:06:55,000
[mafioso 1] Who--
who the hell are you people, anyway?

83
00:06:56,000 --> 00:06:57,000
[groans]

84
00:06:57,000 --> 00:06:58,000
It doesn’t matter.

85
00:06:58,000 --> 00:07:00,000
You’re all dead, do you hear me?

86
00:07:02,000 --> 00:07:04,000
The community will destroy you for this.

87
00:07:05,000 --> 00:07:07,000
You and your entire family!

88
00:07:07,000 --> 00:07:09,000
They’ll torture you…

89
00:07:09,000 --> 00:07:11,000
they’ll cut you up…

90
00:07:11,000 --> 00:07:13,000
They’ll make you taste hell!

91
00:07:18,000 --> 00:07:19,000
[thud]

92
00:07:21,000 --> 00:07:22,000
Family?

93
00:07:23,000 --> 00:07:24,000
What's that?

94
00:07:31,000 --> 00:07:33,000
[loud gulping]

95
00:07:35,000 --> 00:07:36,000
[Melody] I can’t hear it very clearly,

96
00:07:37,000 --> 00:07:39,000
but there’s a commotion going on
inside the building.

97
00:07:40,000 --> 00:07:42,000
[Kurapika] Something must have happened.

98
00:07:42,000 --> 00:07:44,000
Contact the leader!

99
00:07:45,000 --> 00:07:46,000
I understand.

100
00:07:47,000 --> 00:07:49,000
I’ll call Linssen and Basho, too.

101
00:07:50,000 --> 00:07:52,000
And I want the both of you to head inside.

102
00:07:54,000 --> 00:07:55,000
[mafioso 2] Wait…

103
00:07:56,000 --> 00:07:57,000
What?

104
00:07:58,000 --> 00:07:59,000
[mafioso 3] There’s no one here…

105
00:08:02,000 --> 00:08:04,000
[mafioso 4]
Where did they go? Search the place!

106
00:08:04,000 --> 00:08:06,000
[mafioso 5]
Hey, what happened to the merchandise?!

107
00:08:06,000 --> 00:08:08,000
[mafioso 6]
Get outta here! Head underground, now!

108
00:08:11,000 --> 00:08:12,000
I’m inside,

109
00:08:13,000 --> 00:08:15,000
and it appears that everyone
in the auction house has disappeared.

110
00:08:17,000 --> 00:08:18,000
The whole place is in a state of panic.

111
00:08:19,000 --> 00:08:21,000
It’s completely out of control.

112
00:08:22,000 --> 00:08:25,000
The merchandise.
What about the merchandise?

113
00:08:25,000 --> 00:08:27,000
[Kurapika] Melody is heading
to the underground safe.

114
00:08:30,000 --> 00:08:31,000
[mafioso 7] It-- it’s empty!

115
00:08:32,000 --> 00:08:34,000
[mafioso 8] The goods for today’s auction…

116
00:08:34,000 --> 00:08:36,000
they’ve been stolen!

117
00:08:36,000 --> 00:08:38,000
[mafioso 7] Who could’ve done this?

118
00:08:38,000 --> 00:08:39,000
[mafioso 8] Damn it!

119
00:08:39,000 --> 00:08:40,000
Where the hell did they go?!

120
00:08:40,000 --> 00:08:42,000
[mafioso 9]
Split up and look for ‘em, you idiot!

121
00:08:42,000 --> 00:08:43,000
[mafioso 10] Let’s go!

122
00:08:43,000 --> 00:08:46,000
Get the word out to every family!
And quick!

123
00:08:49,000 --> 00:08:50,000
[Dalzollene] Okay, understood.

124
00:08:51,000 --> 00:08:54,000
We’re going to catch those thieves,
no matter what it takes.

125
00:08:56,000 --> 00:08:57,000
I’m on my way now.

126
00:08:57,000 --> 00:08:59,000
Rendezvous with Linssen and Basho
behind the building.

127
00:08:59,000 --> 00:09:01,000
They’ll meet you in the Central Square.

128
00:09:02,000 --> 00:09:04,000
-Squala.
-Yes, sir.

129
00:09:05,000 --> 00:09:06,000
[Dalzollene] Leave five dogs behind…

130
00:09:06,000 --> 00:09:07,000
just in case.

131
00:09:08,000 --> 00:09:09,000
Right.

132
00:09:09,000 --> 00:09:10,000
[Dalzollene] Listen up!

133
00:09:10,000 --> 00:09:11,000
Don’t take your eyes off the boss!

134
00:09:12,000 --> 00:09:14,000
And don’t let anyone in the room
until we’re back.

135
00:09:15,000 --> 00:09:16,000
[both] Yes, sir.

136
00:09:17,000 --> 00:09:19,000
[mafioso 11] All of the roads are sealed.

137
00:09:19,000 --> 00:09:21,000
The only remaining escape route is by air!

138
00:09:22,000 --> 00:09:25,000
If you see any suspicious aircraft,
contact me immediately.

139
00:09:25,000 --> 00:09:27,000
But make sure not to kill them!

140
00:09:28,000 --> 00:09:32,000
The community has offered a large reward
to the gang that finds the thieves.

141
00:09:32,000 --> 00:09:35,000
Remember!
You have to take them alive!

142
00:09:43,000 --> 00:09:44,000
[Boss] No merchandise?

143
00:09:44,000 --> 00:09:45,000
[Uvogin] None.

144
00:09:46,000 --> 00:09:48,000
In fact, the vault was completely empty.

145
00:09:49,000 --> 00:09:52,000
The auctioneer was the only one
who knew the whole situation,

146
00:09:52,000 --> 00:09:54,000
and according to him,

147
00:09:54,000 --> 00:09:57,000
all of the items were taken
to a new location a few hours ago.

148
00:09:58,000 --> 00:09:59,000
It’s like...

149
00:09:59,000 --> 00:10:03,000
they expected this to happen
and were fully prepared for it.

150
00:10:03,000 --> 00:10:04,000
Oh?

151
00:10:04,000 --> 00:10:08,000
Don’t you think the timing
is just a little too coincidental?

152
00:10:10,000 --> 00:10:12,000
If you wanna know what I think…

153
00:10:13,000 --> 00:10:15,000
we’ve got a Judas among us.

154
00:10:17,000 --> 00:10:18,000
So, you're saying...

155
00:10:18,000 --> 00:10:20,000
that one of us is a traitor?

156
00:10:24,000 --> 00:10:25,000
[Boss] No.

157
00:10:25,000 --> 00:10:27,000
There isn’t a traitor.

158
00:10:28,000 --> 00:10:29,000
And if you ask me...

159
00:10:30,000 --> 00:10:31,000
Judas was nothing of the sort.

160
00:10:33,000 --> 00:10:37,000
It’s said that Judas betrayed Jesus
for 30 pieces of silver.

161
00:10:38,000 --> 00:10:40,000
But to betray all of us…

162
00:10:41,000 --> 00:10:43,000
what would one ask of the Mafia?

163
00:10:47,000 --> 00:10:48,000
Think about it.

164
00:10:49,000 --> 00:10:51,000
What would the traitor gain
by selling us out to them?

165
00:10:53,000 --> 00:10:54,000
Money?

166
00:10:55,000 --> 00:10:56,000
Fame?

167
00:10:56,000 --> 00:10:57,000
Status?

168
00:11:00,000 --> 00:11:02,000
Would that be enough to gratify any of us?

169
00:11:03,000 --> 00:11:05,000
Or to slake our thirst in any way?

170
00:11:06,000 --> 00:11:09,000
[pensive inhale]
Nobody I’ve met is like that, no.

171
00:11:10,000 --> 00:11:11,000
[Boss] Of course not.

172
00:11:12,000 --> 00:11:14,000
And that’s not all that doesn’t add up.

173
00:11:14,000 --> 00:11:15,000
It’s not?

174
00:11:16,000 --> 00:11:18,000
If there was an informant,

175
00:11:18,000 --> 00:11:21,000
the Mafia’s response
was pitifully inadequate.

176
00:11:21,000 --> 00:11:23,000
If they had known beforehand,

177
00:11:23,000 --> 00:11:26,000
that Class-A bounties
would appear at the auction

178
00:11:26,000 --> 00:11:27,000
from out of nowhere,

179
00:11:28,000 --> 00:11:31,000
they certainly would have
bolstered their security.

180
00:11:33,000 --> 00:11:35,000
The guests came unarmed

181
00:11:35,000 --> 00:11:37,000
which tells me no one warned them.

182
00:11:37,000 --> 00:11:39,000
I can’t argue with that.

183
00:11:41,000 --> 00:11:43,000
And that is why I believe...

184
00:11:44,000 --> 00:11:46,000
that while someone did tip them off,

185
00:11:46,000 --> 00:11:48,000
it wasn’t terribly specific.

186
00:11:49,000 --> 00:11:50,000
However...

187
00:11:50,000 --> 00:11:53,000
someone high up in the Mafia community

188
00:11:53,000 --> 00:11:55,000
believed that information.

189
00:11:58,000 --> 00:12:00,000
Okay, I think I follow you.

190
00:12:00,000 --> 00:12:04,000
But I don’t see how this information
is getting from A to B.

191
00:12:05,000 --> 00:12:06,000
Whatever.

192
00:12:06,000 --> 00:12:08,000
So, what do you want us to do now?

193
00:12:09,000 --> 00:12:12,000
When you spoke with the auctioneer,

194
00:12:12,000 --> 00:12:14,000
did you ask where the merchandise
was moved?

195
00:12:14,000 --> 00:12:15,000
[Uvogin] I did,

196
00:12:16,000 --> 00:12:18,000
but he kept insisting he didn’t know,

197
00:12:18,000 --> 00:12:20,000
all the way up until he died.

198
00:12:20,000 --> 00:12:22,000
And Feitan tortured him, so…

199
00:12:23,000 --> 00:12:26,000
He had the worst luck of anyone today.

200
00:12:28,000 --> 00:12:31,000
[Boss] Did you manage to get the names
of anyone who might know?

201
00:12:31,000 --> 00:12:33,000
Do you even have to ask?

202
00:12:34,000 --> 00:12:38,000
The auction is run
by the heads of the Mafia community.

203
00:12:39,000 --> 00:12:43,000
Leaders of gangs in each
of the ten districts around the world.

204
00:12:43,000 --> 00:12:45,000
They’re called... the Ten Dons.

205
00:12:46,000 --> 00:12:50,000
This is the one time of year
that all ten gather in one place

206
00:12:50,000 --> 00:12:52,000
to discuss business and issue orders…

207
00:12:53,000 --> 00:12:55,000
orders which are carried out
by a special force

208
00:12:55,000 --> 00:12:57,000
called the Shadow Beasts.

209
00:12:57,000 --> 00:12:59,000
The team is comprised of combatants

210
00:13:00,000 --> 00:13:01,000
which are hand-picked by each Don.

211
00:13:02,000 --> 00:13:03,000
The best of the best.

212
00:13:05,000 --> 00:13:06,000
Ah, I see.

213
00:13:07,000 --> 00:13:08,000
And since the Shadow Beasts

214
00:13:08,000 --> 00:13:11,000
weren’t called upon
to guard the auction house,

215
00:13:12,000 --> 00:13:14,000
the theory that they
didn’t know we were coming

216
00:13:14,000 --> 00:13:16,000
has even more credibility.

217
00:13:17,000 --> 00:13:18,000
[Uvogin] That does make sense.

218
00:13:19,000 --> 00:13:21,000
[Boss] The question remains:

219
00:13:21,000 --> 00:13:23,000
how did they move the merchandise?

220
00:13:24,000 --> 00:13:25,000
That’s what I’m wondering.

221
00:13:26,000 --> 00:13:29,000
I heard a single Shadow Beast member
turned up at the vault.

222
00:13:33,000 --> 00:13:36,000
The safe itself is 25 square meters

223
00:13:36,000 --> 00:13:39,000
and it was packed full of items
waiting to be auctioned off.

224
00:13:41,000 --> 00:13:45,000
He walked in and then
walked right back out, empty-handed.

225
00:13:46,000 --> 00:13:48,000
The vault was completely bare.

226
00:13:48,000 --> 00:13:51,000
It was a guy in sunglasses
who called himself the Owl.

227
00:13:54,000 --> 00:13:58,000
He must have a Nen Ability
quite similar to Shizuku’s.

228
00:13:58,000 --> 00:13:59,000
[Uvogin] Probably.

229
00:13:59,000 --> 00:14:00,000
But surely,

230
00:14:00,000 --> 00:14:04,000
once 500 people disappeared,
they had to realize…

231
00:14:07,000 --> 00:14:09,000
that they’re dealing with Nen users.

232
00:14:09,000 --> 00:14:11,000
We can take them, can’t we?

233
00:14:11,000 --> 00:14:13,000
[Boss] Of course.

234
00:14:15,000 --> 00:14:17,000
Put on a show for the pursuers.

235
00:14:17,000 --> 00:14:20,000
A disturbance big enough
to draw out the Shadow Beasts.

236
00:14:22,000 --> 00:14:25,000
[Uvogin chuckling excitedly]
I can hardly wait!

237
00:14:31,000 --> 00:14:33,000
[mafioso 12] It’s them!
They’re in a hot air balloon!

238
00:14:33,000 --> 00:14:37,000
[mafioso 13] Looks like It’s headed
for the Gordeau Desert! We're in pursuit!

239
00:14:38,000 --> 00:14:40,000
[leader 1] A hot air balloon?
Not an airship?

240
00:14:40,000 --> 00:14:41,000
[leader 2] That’s impossible!

241
00:14:42,000 --> 00:14:44,000
Then what happened
to the hundreds of guests?

242
00:14:44,000 --> 00:14:46,000
[leader 3] You know I’m starting to think,
maybe we’re not dealing

243
00:14:46,000 --> 00:14:49,000
with an ordinary band
of armed thugs after all…

244
00:14:49,000 --> 00:14:50,000
Huh?

245
00:14:50,000 --> 00:14:52,000
[leader 2] Get the Ten Dons on the phone!

246
00:14:52,000 --> 00:14:54,000
Ask them to dispatch
the Shadow Beasts!

247
00:14:55,000 --> 00:14:56,000
Go!

248
00:14:59,000 --> 00:15:02,000
They’re moving.
Head for the Gordeau Desert.

249
00:15:02,000 --> 00:15:03,000
Okay!

250
00:15:04,000 --> 00:15:05,000
Roger that.

251
00:15:29,000 --> 00:15:31,000
[mafioso 14] Get down here right now

252
00:15:31,000 --> 00:15:34,000
and we’ll even let you decide
whether we drown you or bury you!

253
00:15:35,000 --> 00:15:36,000
[amused laugh]

254
00:15:37,000 --> 00:15:39,000
Just look at the reception
we’re getting, huh?

255
00:15:39,000 --> 00:15:42,000
I’m not gonna have to clean
all this up, am I?

256
00:15:42,000 --> 00:15:43,000
[Feitan] They’re not worth it.

257
00:15:43,000 --> 00:15:44,000
[Uvogin] Hey!

258
00:15:45,000 --> 00:15:47,000
You guys can stay out of this.

259
00:15:47,000 --> 00:15:49,000
I’ll take care of ‘em myself!

260
00:15:52,000 --> 00:15:53,000
[mafioso 15] Wait!

261
00:16:06,000 --> 00:16:09,000
Are you the ones
who kidnapped all of our guests?

262
00:16:09,000 --> 00:16:10,000
Yeah.

263
00:16:10,000 --> 00:16:12,000
Well, you sure have a lot of guts,

264
00:16:12,000 --> 00:16:14,000
I’ll give you that much.

265
00:16:14,000 --> 00:16:16,000
Now which one of you is the leader?

266
00:16:18,000 --> 00:16:19,000
[silly chuckling]

267
00:16:21,000 --> 00:16:22,000
You punk!

268
00:16:27,000 --> 00:16:28,000
[gasps]

269
00:16:31,000 --> 00:16:32,000
[throaty chuckling]

270
00:16:32,000 --> 00:16:33,000
[terrified groan]

271
00:16:47,000 --> 00:16:49,000
[growling]

272
00:16:50,000 --> 00:16:52,000
[roars]

273
00:16:55,000 --> 00:16:57,000
[Nobunaga] His philosophy is simple:

274
00:16:57,000 --> 00:17:00,000
Be stronger than anyone or anything.

275
00:17:00,000 --> 00:17:02,000
Nothing more.

276
00:17:03,000 --> 00:17:05,000
It’d take a heck of a lot more
than an ordinary gun

277
00:17:06,000 --> 00:17:08,000
to leave even a small scratch on him.

278
00:17:08,000 --> 00:17:10,000
[Feitan] Physically, he’s the strongest.

279
00:17:11,000 --> 00:17:14,000
[Franklin] It’s like watching a gorilla
stomping ants.

280
00:17:16,000 --> 00:17:18,000
[Nobunaga] They just keep coming, huh?

281
00:17:18,000 --> 00:17:21,000
Don’t those guys realize
they’re only gonna end up dead?

282
00:17:22,000 --> 00:17:23,000
You know, just watching isn’t much fun.

283
00:17:24,000 --> 00:17:25,000
Does anyone want to play cards?

284
00:17:25,000 --> 00:17:27,000
-I do.
-Count me in.

285
00:17:31,000 --> 00:17:32,000
Look!

286
00:17:32,000 --> 00:17:34,000
I see 'em.

287
00:17:41,000 --> 00:17:42,000
[Uvogin sighs disappointedly]

288
00:17:43,000 --> 00:17:47,000
This won’t even get me warmed up
before the Shadow Beasts get here.

289
00:17:57,000 --> 00:17:59,000
[groans] Ow…

290
00:18:01,000 --> 00:18:02,000
A rifle?

291
00:18:03,000 --> 00:18:04,000
That is so annoying.

292
00:18:06,000 --> 00:18:08,000
Trying to take me out from afar, huh?

293
00:18:10,000 --> 00:18:11,000
[gasps]

294
00:18:13,000 --> 00:18:14,000
[short grunt of pain]

295
00:18:18,000 --> 00:18:20,000
Oh yeah! That was a perfect shot!

296
00:18:21,000 --> 00:18:22,000
[leader 4] That's enough!

297
00:18:24,000 --> 00:18:26,000
Don’t flatter yourself, you monster.

298
00:18:26,000 --> 00:18:27,000
You’re not all that tough.

299
00:18:28,000 --> 00:18:30,000
This super-bazooka is powerful enough

300
00:18:30,000 --> 00:18:32,000
to take out a tank.

301
00:18:33,000 --> 00:18:35,000
I’m about to blow you to bits!

302
00:18:35,000 --> 00:18:38,000
That… hurt my feelings.

303
00:18:38,000 --> 00:18:42,000
See I don’t like being compared
to some measly little tank.

304
00:18:43,000 --> 00:18:44,000
You’re dead!

305
00:18:50,000 --> 00:18:51,000
Did I get him?

306
00:19:00,000 --> 00:19:01,000
-[shocked gulp]
-[gasps]

307
00:19:03,000 --> 00:19:06,000
Well, whaddya know?
That actually kinda hurt.

308
00:19:06,000 --> 00:19:08,000
[terrified shouts]

309
00:19:10,000 --> 00:19:13,000
[derisive snort]
You think I’m gonna let you get away?!

310
00:19:16,000 --> 00:19:18,000
[Kurapika]
It appears that the enemy can use Nen.

311
00:19:18,000 --> 00:19:20,000
And he’s incredibly powerful.

312
00:19:26,000 --> 00:19:28,000
The men who got here first are all dead.

313
00:19:29,000 --> 00:19:31,000
Firearms are useless against him.

314
00:19:32,000 --> 00:19:33,000
That’s impossible…

315
00:19:34,000 --> 00:19:36,000
Take a good look and see for yourself.

316
00:19:36,000 --> 00:19:38,000
His aura’s simply unbelievable.

317
00:19:39,000 --> 00:19:41,000
As is the body count.

318
00:19:44,000 --> 00:19:45,000
It’s insane.

319
00:19:45,000 --> 00:19:47,000
Just what is he, anyway?

320
00:19:47,000 --> 00:19:48,000
Don’t know.

321
00:19:48,000 --> 00:19:51,000
But he’s tearing through all those people
like scraps of paper!

322
00:19:51,000 --> 00:19:52,000
Look, just forget it!

323
00:19:53,000 --> 00:19:55,000
No way I’m trying to capture that!

324
00:19:55,000 --> 00:19:56,000
He’s got a point there.

325
00:19:57,000 --> 00:19:58,000
If we can beat him,

326
00:19:58,000 --> 00:19:59,000
I don’t see how.

327
00:20:00,000 --> 00:20:02,000
-I agree.
-[Squala] Huh?

328
00:20:03,000 --> 00:20:05,000
However, we still have our mission

329
00:20:05,000 --> 00:20:07,000
and we can’t just walk away now.

330
00:20:08,000 --> 00:20:09,000
But still…!

331
00:20:09,000 --> 00:20:10,000
Hold on!

332
00:20:11,000 --> 00:20:13,000
I can’t tell where it’s coming from

333
00:20:14,000 --> 00:20:16,000
but I hear another heartbeat.

334
00:20:26,000 --> 00:20:27,000
[both gasp]

335
00:20:31,000 --> 00:20:33,000
I am the Shadow Beast, Worm.

336
00:20:34,000 --> 00:20:36,000
Which family do you belong to?

337
00:20:38,000 --> 00:20:40,000
[Dalzollene] We’re bodyguards.

338
00:20:40,000 --> 00:20:42,000
We’ve been hired by the Nostrade family.

339
00:20:44,000 --> 00:20:45,000
I understand.

340
00:20:46,000 --> 00:20:48,000
It seems that you can use Nen a bit

341
00:20:48,000 --> 00:20:49,000
but don’t bother.

342
00:20:50,000 --> 00:20:53,000
[Shadow Beast]
These are no ordinary thugs.

343
00:20:53,000 --> 00:20:56,000
To them, killing’s a part
of their daily routine.

344
00:20:57,000 --> 00:21:00,000
You could say
that they’re professional killers.

345
00:21:01,000 --> 00:21:04,000
And as pros ourselves, we’ll handle it.

346
00:21:07,000 --> 00:21:08,000
My name’s Rabid Dog.

347
00:21:09,000 --> 00:21:10,000
And mine is Leech.

348
00:21:10,000 --> 00:21:12,000
You, uh... can call me Porcupine.

349
00:21:14,000 --> 00:21:18,000
Sit back and leave this job
to the Shadow Beasts.

350
00:21:22,000 --> 00:21:23,000
It’s them…

351
00:21:23,000 --> 00:21:24,000
the Shadow Beasts!

352
00:21:26,000 --> 00:21:30,000
[narrator] The Mafia community
has unleashed the dreaded Shadow Beasts

353
00:21:30,000 --> 00:21:32,000
upon the bandits who attacked the auction.

354
00:21:33,000 --> 00:21:36,000
And Kurapika has yet to realize
that these bandits,

355
00:21:36,000 --> 00:21:38,000
they will soon meet in battle

356
00:21:38,000 --> 00:21:41,000
are, in fact... the Phantom Troupe.

357
00:21:41,000 --> 00:21:44,000
[theme song playing]

358
00:22:50,000 --> 00:22:51,000
[Gon] Coming up:

359
00:22:51,000 --> 00:22:53,000
-Gon...
-[Killua] ...and Killua’s…

360
00:22:53,000 --> 00:22:54,000
[both] Hunterpedia!

361
00:22:54,000 --> 00:22:56,000
-I’m Gon!
-I’m Killua!

362
00:22:56,000 --> 00:22:57,000
[both] And this is our Hunterpedia!

363
00:22:57,000 --> 00:22:59,000
Today, we're introducing Baise!

364
00:22:59,000 --> 00:23:01,000
Her ability’s Instant Lover.

365
00:23:01,000 --> 00:23:03,000
She pretends she’s into a guy,

366
00:23:03,000 --> 00:23:04,000
-then she goes in for a kiss!
-[smack]

367
00:23:04,000 --> 00:23:06,000
So, all you men better be careful!

368
00:23:06,000 --> 00:23:07,000
[both] Smooch!

369
00:23:12,000 --> 00:23:14,000
[Gon] Next time:
"Buildup x to a x Fierce Battle"!

370
00:23:15,000 --> 00:23:17,000
So, uh…
Do bananas count as a snack?

371
00:23:17,000 --> 00:23:19,000
[Killua] What about chocolate?
Is that a snack?

372
00:23:19,000 --> 00:23:21,000
[Gon] Yeah, it’s always been a snack!
